WEBVTT

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.410
Huh?! Himekawa withdrew from school?!

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.790
Yeah. He didn't drop out,
though--he transferred.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.830
What's going on, Coach?

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.330
Who knows? I only heard myself today.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.160
Did you know about this, Terauchi?

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.200
No...

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.040
This is very sudden...

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.830
What reason did he give for transferring?

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.950
He just wrote "Because my family is moving."

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.120
Even so, it's too sudden!

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.580
Is he going to quit skate-leading, too?

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.330
I wonder if it'd been decided a while ago,
but he just didn't say anything...

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:54.290
You know, Himekawa can be
pretty secretive sometimes.

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:57.450
More importantly, what's going
to happen to our team formation?

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.410
Without our ace, the balance--

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.120
Maeshima?!

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.410
Did you think things would work out somehow
if you just rushed out suddenly?

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.620
You know, if you just left like that,

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.950
you would definitely have
gotten lost by the roadside.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.490
I wonder about that.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:13.160
What's with that attitude?!

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.330
<i>I'm</i> the one who told you what school
Himekawa transferred to

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:18.200
and got the bullet train tickets!

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.040
Ow...!

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.490
Why are you so worried about that guy, anyway?

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:24.120
Weren't you more self-centered than that?

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:26.200
I don't know why, either.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.240
But it kind of annoyed me...

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.950
I couldn't just sit still.

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.740
Really? Oh, well.

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:34.160
I included Himekawa when
thinking about our assets, too.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.950
I don't plan on letting him go easily.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.330
Don't keep talking over there.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:41.620
Come over here and eat lunch.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.450
I have frozen mandarin oranges, too.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.490
You an auntie or something?

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:47.120
Dad's worried, too.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.870
Who're you calling "Dad"?

