00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.540
Gotcha.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:18.740
Is this the place?

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:19.660
Maeshima!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.660
Oh, how much was it?

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:22.910
Wait right there!

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.080
Where's your permit to enter the school?

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.370
Huh? I know someone who goes here...

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.330
There's no unauthorized entry allowed.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.900
If you want to go inside,
you have to get an appointment--

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:32.160
I just want to go talk to this guy!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.870
I'll make it fast, so it should be fine, right?

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:34.790
The police.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:35.170
Huh?

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.870
We can't have fights with
students from other schools.

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.450
I'll call the police.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:44.330
Sorry about that! We'll leave for now. Come on.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.160
Hey--

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.240
Idiot, why are you going in
through the front door?!

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:51.160
Just wait... I'll figure out
a way to sneak in...

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.450
<i>You're</i> the idiot.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.290
Huh?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.490
Taking the back way
isn't the solution to everything.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.910
I'm Shotaro Terauchi,
third year at Ionodai High School.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:03.990
I have an appointment with Coach Kumada
from the skate-leading club.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.290
Oh, yes. He told me about you.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.080
We called ahead on our way over.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:17.370
Sasugai, you should learn how
to make frontal attacks like this, too.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.240
I gratefully accept your kind advice.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:24.290
More importantly, what's this
about a skate-leading club?

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:25.330
Isn't it great?

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.790
He's not quitting the sport.
It's like he's just changing teams.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.510
No, wait, that's weird! Why now, of all--

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.240
Be quiet.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.370
Yes, sir...

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.240
Kogahara High School.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:39.240
They're a new team that started up officially

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.240
after they finished building
this rink last year.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.410
The school is also putting a lot
of resources into the team.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:49.870
For example, they invited Coach Kumada,
famous for his eye for talent.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:55.200
This school's track record
only goes back a year, huh?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.330
No wonder it wasn't on my list.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.700
You must be Coach Kumada.

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:02.620
Please excuse my sudden call earlier.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:06.620
I'm Terauchi, captain of the
skate-leading club at Ionodai High School.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.870
You've come a long way. Welcome.

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:11.040
Izumi! Come here for a second.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.870
Your old teammates have come to see you.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.990
Go and talk to them for a bit.

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.910
I'm in the middle of practice.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.110
Sorry about that.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:22.900
It's fine--

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.990
Wait a minute!

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.370
Why did you transfer schools?!

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:29.240
What do you mean by changing teams?! Hey--

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:32.580
<i>I'm sorry</i> , but could you
please refrain from shouting?

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.790
You'll surprise the other club members.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:35.870
You understand, right?

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.830
Uh, yes... I'm sorry.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.660
You can watch practice
for as long as you'd like.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.830
They're very faithful to the basics.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:49.910
Yes.

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:53.120
It doesn't feel like he's teaching
them anything especially flashy.

